<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:32:50 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>3 位 2000 年代首次亮相后被误认为另一位艺术家的艺术家</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-artists-of-the-2000s-that-were-mistaken-for-another-artist-following-their-debut-release/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在听到他们的首张专辑时，这三位 2000 年代的艺术家被误认为是另一位超前的艺术家。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-artists-of-the-2000s-that-were-mistaken-for-another-artist-following-their-debut-release/"&gt;首张专辑发行后被误认为是 2000 年代 3 位艺术家的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-artists-of-the-2000s-that-were-mistaken-for-another-artist-following-their-debut-release/</guid></item><item><title>20 世纪 90 年代末和 2000 年代初最尴尬的 3 次 TRL 采访</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-awkward-trl-interviews-from-the-late-90s-and-early-2000s/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这些尴尬的 TRL 采访是该节目中最令人难忘的节目之一，数百万千禧一代放学后赶回家观看。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-awkward-trl-interviews-from-the-late-90s-and-early-2000s/"&gt;90 年代末和 2000 年代初最尴尬的 TRL 采访的第 3 篇&lt;/a&gt;文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 22:20:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-awkward-trl-interviews-from-the-late-90s-and-early-2000s/</guid></item><item><title>时隔十年后，The Roots 带着新专辑回归：这就是这些年来让他们在一起的原因</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-roots-return-with-a-new-album-after-a-decade-long-hiatus-heres-what-kept-them-together-all-these-years/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;The Roots 透露，他们正在制作十多年来的第一张专辑，并详细介绍了帮助他们再次创作的即兴演奏会。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-roots-return-with-a-new-album-after-a-decade-long-hiatus-heres-what-kept-them-together-all-these-years/"&gt;《The Roots 在十年的中断后带着新专辑回归：这就是这些年来让他们在一起的原因》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 22:17:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-roots-return-with-a-new-album-after-a-decade-long-hiatus-heres-what-kept-them-together-all-these-years/</guid></item><item><title>奥利维亚·罗德里戈 (Olivia Rodrigo) 的“解开之旅”遭遇严重倒卖问题，Ticketmaster 出手制止</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/olivia-rodrigos-the-unraveled-tour-was-hit-with-serious-scalping-issues-so-ticketmaster-stepped-in-to-stop-it/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Ticketmaster 已介入，阻止票贩子毁掉奥利维亚·罗德里戈 (Olivia Rodrigo) 的“未解之谜巡演”(The Unraveled Tour)。该公司已收回大量门票，并以票面价格将其返还给粉丝。 2026 年 8 月 20 日，Ticketmaster 分享了一篇社交媒体帖子，解释说他们已经找回了罗德里戈备受瞩目的门票 […]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/olivia-rodrigos-the-unraveled-tour-was-hit-with-serious-scalping-issues-so-ticketmaster-stepped-in-to-stop-it/"&gt;奥利维亚·罗德里戈 (Olivia Rodrigo) 的“The Unraveled Tour”遭遇严重倒卖问题，Ticketmaster 出面制止的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:28:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/olivia-rodrigos-the-unraveled-tour-was-hit-with-serious-scalping-issues-so-ticketmaster-stepped-in-to-stop-it/</guid></item><item><title>凯西·马斯格雷夫斯 (Kacey Musgraves) 想用限量版成人产品结束你的卧室“干燥期”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/kacey-musgraves-wants-to-end-your-bedroom-dry-spell-with-a-limited-edition-adult-product/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乡村音乐巨星凯西·马斯格雷夫斯 (Kacey Musgraves) 与女性健康品牌合作推出限量版个人润滑油瓶。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/kacey-musgraves-wants-to-end-your-bedroom-dry-spell-with-a-limited-edition-adult-product/"&gt;凯西·马斯格雷夫斯 (Kacey Musgraves) 想用限量版成人产品结束卧室“干燥期”，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:02:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/kacey-musgraves-wants-to-end-your-bedroom-dry-spell-with-a-limited-edition-adult-product/</guid></item><item><title>当汉尼拔·莱克特不吃人的时候，他显然是在写古典音乐</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/when-he-wasnt-eating-people-hannibal-lecter-was-apparently-writing-classical-music/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;传奇演员安东尼·霍普金斯讲述了他对古典音乐的深厚热爱以及为什么他最终制作了一张关于他的生活的专辑。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章《 &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/when-he-wasnt-eating-people-hannibal-lecter-was-apparently-writing-classical-music/"&gt;当他不吃人时，汉尼拔·莱克特显然是在写古典音乐》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:57:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/when-he-wasnt-eating-people-hannibal-lecter-was-apparently-writing-classical-music/</guid></item><item><title>Turnstile 宣布他们的“Never Enough”专辑的新版本，嘉宾名单会让你感到困惑</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/turnstile-announced-a-new-version-of-their-never-enough-album-and-the-guest-list-is-going-to-baffle-you/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Turnstile 格莱美获奖专辑《Never Enough》的新版本将邀请埃尔顿·约翰、Slayyyter 和 Dying Fetus 等众多嘉宾参与。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/turnstile-announced-a-new-version-of-their-never-enough-album-and-the-guest-list-is-going-to-baffle-you/"&gt;Turnstile 宣布他们的“Never Enough”专辑的新版本，嘉宾名单会让你感到困惑，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:16:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/turnstile-announced-a-new-version-of-their-never-enough-album-and-the-guest-list-is-going-to-baffle-you/</guid></item><item><title>《使命召唤：现代战争 4》详细介绍了所有 Beta 模式和奖励</t